"href=\"%(zulip_web_link)s\">Zulip chat</a>. Please do not ask for help "
"using Mixxx on Zulip; use the <a href=\"%(forum_link)s\">forum</a> for "
"that instead."
msgstr ""

#: templates/pages/get-involved.html:28
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Get a <a href=\"%(com_github_link)s\">GitHub</a> account and <a "
"href=\"%(using_git_wiki_link)s \">fork your own branch</a>!"
msgstr ""

#: templates/pages/get-involved.html:31
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Pick a bug off our <a href=\"%(easy_bug_list_link)s \">Easy Bugs List</a>"
" and start hacking!<br><br> Fixed it? Your name will be in the <a "
"href=\"%(mixxx_credits_link)s\">Mixxx credits</a>!"
msgstr ""

#: templates/pages/get-involved.html:34
msgid ""
"You don't even have to know C++. There are developers who got into Mixxx "
"development while learning C++ along the way."
msgstr ""

